    "detailed_description": "<strong>&quot;\u65f6\u7a7a\u4e09\u5206\u4e4b\u4e09 Tritime Space&quot;</strong> is a stand-alone monster-killing game that uses music beats to perform action strikes and release cool skills:<br>1. You can sense the rhythm from the world to strengthen your attack, and you can combine the rhythm and buttons to create different skill output methods! <i>--Rhythm is energy, isn't it?</i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127630/extras/Rhythm.gif?t=1724237072\" /></span><br>2. There are multiple cool skills to obtain, and skills can also cause powerful damage when combined with the right rhythm timing!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127630/extras/Skills.gif?t=1724237072\" /></span><br>3. Crazy enemies will attack you mercilessly, and enemies will also release powerful skills to hit you, and each map series has a corresponding boss, who can release stronger skills, with higher difficulty, and of course you will get richer rewards after defeating the enemy!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127630/extras/098187d8a91b86242fd4d531b20260eb.poster.avif?t=1724237072\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127630/extras/098187d8a91b86242fd4d531b20260eb.webm?t=1724237072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127630/extras/098187d8a91b86242fd4d531b20260eb.mp4?t=1724237072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>4. As the map level and progress, you will unlock stronger skills, and as the level increases, you can strengthen your favorite skills. Can you disperse the enemy?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127630/extras/d091d17beac1781067ff29f6f6d1c73e.poster.avif?t=1724237072\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127630/extras/d091d17beac1781067ff29f6f6d1c73e.webm?t=1724237072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127630/extras/d091d17beac1781067ff29f6f6d1c73e.mp4?t=1724237072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
